// expect: trap
// A bounded repetition of alternatives that match the same text does not remember where it failed,
// so it backtracks exponentially; `matches` traps once the attempt spends its budget.
import avin.regex.Regex

main()
    println(Regex("(a|a){1,60}b").matches("aaaab"))
    println(Regex("(a|a){1,60}b").matches("aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"))
